Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:21:56 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] plugin: support passage stores alongside pass

The applet only read .gpg files from the pass store, so passage users
(the age based fork of pass) saw an empty list. Also list the .age files
of the passage store and decrypt them by running passage show.

BUG: 459051
---
 plugin/passwordsmodel.cpp | 39 ++++++++++++++++-------
 plugin/passwordsmodel.h   |  5 ++-
 plugin/providerbase.cpp   | 65 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--------
 plugin/providerbase.h     |  2 ++
 4 files changed, 86 insertions(+), 25 deletions(-)

diff --git a/plugin/passwordsmodel.cpp b/plugin/passwordsmodel.cpp
